*> Test of value effects (28 section 5; core/src/ench-5.cob): add, multiply, set, exponential, all_of folding in order and remove_binomial. Ten-thousandths, binomial in thousandths.
 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. TEST-ENCH-5.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 COPY TESTLIB.
 01 WS-I1 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-I2 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-I3 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-I4 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-I5 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-I6 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-I7 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-I8 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-I9 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-I10 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-I11 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-I12 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-I13 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-I14 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-I15 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-I16 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-T1 PIC X(200).
 01 WS-T2 PIC X(200).
 01 WS-T3 PIC X(200).
 01 WS-O1 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-O2 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-O3 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-O4 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-O5 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-O6 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-O7 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-O8 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-O9 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-O10 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-O11 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-O12 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-X1 PIC X(48).
 01 WS-X2 PIC X(48).
 01 WS-X3 PIC X(48).
 01 WS-OBS PIC X(240).
 01 WS-E1 PIC -(9)9.
 01 WS-E2 PIC -(9)9.
 01 WS-E3 PIC -(9)9.
 01 WS-E4 PIC -(9)9.
 01 WS-E5 PIC -(9)9.
 01 WS-E6 PIC -(9)9.
 01 WS-E7 PIC -(9)9.
 01 WS-E8 PIC -(9)9.
 01 WS-E9 PIC -(9)9.
 01 WS-E10 PIC -(9)9.
 01 WS-E11 PIC -(9)9.
 01 WS-E12 PIC -(9)9.
 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
     MOVE "acceptance US14 28.5 add, multiply, set and exponential on a value" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-OBSERVED
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-T1
     MOVE "add 1.0" TO WS-T1
     MOVE 1 TO WS-I1
     MOVE 50000 TO WS-I2
     CALL "TOOL-VALUE-FOLD" USING WS-T1 WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-O1 WS-O2
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-OBS
     MOVE WS-O1 TO WS-E1
     MOVE WS-O2 TO WS-E2
     STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) "/" FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E2) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-OBS
     PERFORM ADD-OBS
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-T1
     MOVE "multiply 2.0" TO WS-T1
     MOVE 1 TO WS-I1
     MOVE 30000 TO WS-I2
     CALL "TOOL-VALUE-FOLD" USING WS-T1 WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-O1 WS-O2
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-OBS
     MOVE WS-O1 TO WS-E1
     MOVE WS-O2 TO WS-E2
     STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) "/" FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E2) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-OBS
     PERFORM ADD-OBS
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-T1
     MOVE "set 7.5" TO WS-T1
     MOVE 1 TO WS-I1
     MOVE 30000 TO WS-I2
     CALL "TOOL-VALUE-FOLD" USING WS-T1 WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-O1 WS-O2
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-OBS
     MOVE WS-O1 TO WS-E1
     MOVE WS-O2 TO WS-E2
     STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) "/" FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E2) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-OBS
     PERFORM ADD-OBS
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-T1
     MOVE "exponential 2.0 3.0" TO WS-T1
     MOVE 1 TO WS-I1
     MOVE 30000 TO WS-I2
     CALL "TOOL-VALUE-FOLD" USING WS-T1 WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-O1 WS-O2
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-OBS
     MOVE WS-O1 TO WS-E1
     MOVE WS-O2 TO WS-E2
     STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) "/" FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E2) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-OBS
     PERFORM ADD-OBS
     MOVE "60000/0 60000/0 75000/0 240000/0" TO TL-EXPECTED
     PERFORM CHECK-DONE

     MOVE "acceptance US14 28.5 all_of folds left to right, each receiving the previous result: multiply 2.0 then add linear (level 3 gives 2.0) from 1.0 is 4.0, the reverse order 6.0" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-OBSERVED
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-T1
     MOVE "multiply 2.0 add linear 1 0.5" TO WS-T1
     MOVE 3 TO WS-I1
     MOVE 10000 TO WS-I2
     CALL "TOOL-VALUE-FOLD" USING WS-T1 WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-O1 WS-O2
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-OBS
     MOVE WS-O1 TO WS-E1
     MOVE WS-O2 TO WS-E2
     STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) "/" FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E2) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-OBS
     PERFORM ADD-OBS
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-T1
     MOVE "add linear 1 0.5 multiply 2.0" TO WS-T1
     MOVE 3 TO WS-I1
     MOVE 10000 TO WS-I2
     CALL "TOOL-VALUE-FOLD" USING WS-T1 WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-O1 WS-O2
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-OBS
     MOVE WS-O1 TO WS-E1
     MOVE WS-O2 TO WS-E2
     STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) "/" FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E2) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-OBS
     PERFORM ADD-OBS
     MOVE "40000/0 60000/0" TO TL-EXPECTED
     PERFORM CHECK-DONE

     MOVE "acceptance US14 28.5 an unknown effect type or a missing argument is an error" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-OBSERVED
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-T1
     MOVE "bogus 1" TO WS-T1
     MOVE 1 TO WS-I1
     MOVE 10000 TO WS-I2
     CALL "TOOL-VALUE-FOLD" USING WS-T1 WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-O1 WS-O2
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-OBS
     MOVE WS-O1 TO WS-E1
     MOVE WS-O2 TO WS-E2
     STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) "/" FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E2) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-OBS
     PERFORM ADD-OBS
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-T1
     MOVE "add" TO WS-T1
     MOVE 1 TO WS-I1
     MOVE 10000 TO WS-I2
     CALL "TOOL-VALUE-FOLD" USING WS-T1 WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-O1 WS-O2
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-OBS
     MOVE WS-O1 TO WS-E1
     MOVE WS-O2 TO WS-E2
     STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) "/" FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E2) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-OBS
     PERFORM ADD-OBS
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-T1
     MOVE "add clamped 4 4 5" TO WS-T1
     MOVE 1 TO WS-I1
     MOVE 10000 TO WS-I2
     CALL "TOOL-VALUE-FOLD" USING WS-T1 WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-O1 WS-O2
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-OBS
     MOVE WS-O1 TO WS-E1
     MOVE WS-O2 TO WS-E2
     STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) "/" FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E2) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-OBS
     PERFORM ADD-OBS
     MOVE "10000/2 10000/2 10000/1" TO TL-EXPECTED
     PERFORM CHECK-DONE

     MOVE "acceptance US14 28.5 remove_binomial method: normal approximation only when n > 128 and n p >= 20 and n (1 - p) >= 20" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-OBSERVED
     MOVE 1000000 TO WS-I1
     MOVE 300 TO WS-I2
     CALL "TOOL-BINOMIAL-METHOD" USING WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-O1
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-OBS
     MOVE WS-O1 TO WS-E1
     STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-OBS
     PERFORM ADD-OBS
     MOVE 130000 TO WS-I1
     MOVE 100 TO WS-I2
     CALL "TOOL-BINOMIAL-METHOD" USING WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-O1
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-OBS
     MOVE WS-O1 TO WS-E1
     STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-OBS
     PERFORM ADD-OBS
     MOVE 128000 TO WS-I1
     MOVE 500 TO WS-I2
     CALL "TOOL-BINOMIAL-METHOD" USING WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-O1
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-OBS
     MOVE WS-O1 TO WS-E1
     STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-OBS
     PERFORM ADD-OBS
     MOVE 129000 TO WS-I1
     MOVE 500 TO WS-I2
     CALL "TOOL-BINOMIAL-METHOD" USING WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-O1
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-OBS
     MOVE WS-O1 TO WS-E1
     STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-OBS
     PERFORM ADD-OBS
     MOVE 1000000 TO WS-I1
     MOVE 990 TO WS-I2
     CALL "TOOL-BINOMIAL-METHOD" USING WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-O1
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-OBS
     MOVE WS-O1 TO WS-E1
     STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-OBS
     PERFORM ADD-OBS
     MOVE "1 0 0 1 0" TO TL-EXPECTED
     PERFORM CHECK-DONE

     MOVE "acceptance US14 28.5 exact method draws ceil(n) times: n 10.0 gives 10, 10.5 gives 11" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-OBSERVED
     MOVE 10000 TO WS-I1
     CALL "TOOL-BINOMIAL-DRAWS" USING WS-I1 WS-O1
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-OBS
     MOVE WS-O1 TO WS-E1
     STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-OBS
     PERFORM ADD-OBS
     MOVE 10500 TO WS-I1
     CALL "TOOL-BINOMIAL-DRAWS" USING WS-I1 WS-O1
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-OBS
     MOVE WS-O1 TO WS-E1
     STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-OBS
     PERFORM ADD-OBS
     MOVE 1000 TO WS-I1
     CALL "TOOL-BINOMIAL-DRAWS" USING WS-I1 WS-O1
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-OBS
     MOVE WS-O1 TO WS-E1
     STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-OBS
     PERFORM ADD-OBS
     MOVE "10 11 1" TO TL-EXPECTED
     PERFORM CHECK-DONE

     MOVE "acceptance US14 28.5 worked example 1: Unbreaking III chance 0.75, 10 points, the draws 0.10 0.90 0.50 0.80 0.30 0.74 0.76 0.20 0.99 0.60 give k = 6 and result 4" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-OBSERVED
     MOVE 10000 TO WS-I1
     MOVE 750 TO WS-I2
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-T1
     MOVE "100 900 500 800 300 740 760 200 990 600" TO WS-T1
     CALL "TOOL-BINOMIAL-EXACT" USING WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-T1 WS-O1
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-OBS
     MOVE WS-O1 TO WS-E1
     STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-OBS
     PERFORM ADD-OBS
     MOVE "4000" TO TL-EXPECTED
     PERFORM CHECK-DONE

     MOVE "acceptance US14 28.5 worked example 2: n 1000, p 0.3, Gaussian 0.5: mean 300, sd 14.49, k = 307, result 693" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-OBSERVED
     MOVE 1000000 TO WS-I1
     MOVE 300 TO WS-I2
     MOVE 500 TO WS-I3
     CALL "TOOL-BINOMIAL-NORMAL" USING WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-I3 WS-O1
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-OBS
     MOVE WS-O1 TO WS-E1
     STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-OBS
     PERFORM ADD-OBS
     MOVE "693000" TO TL-EXPECTED
     PERFORM CHECK-DONE

     MOVE "acceptance US14 28.5 the normal draw is clamped to 0 to n: a Gaussian of -100 gives k 0, of +100 gives k n" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-OBSERVED
     MOVE 1000000 TO WS-I1
     MOVE 300 TO WS-I2
     MOVE -100000 TO WS-I3
     CALL "TOOL-BINOMIAL-NORMAL" USING WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-I3 WS-O1
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-OBS
     MOVE WS-O1 TO WS-E1
     STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-OBS
     PERFORM ADD-OBS
     MOVE 1000000 TO WS-I1
     MOVE 300 TO WS-I2
     MOVE 100000 TO WS-I3
     CALL "TOOL-BINOMIAL-NORMAL" USING WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-I3 WS-O1
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-OBS
     MOVE WS-O1 TO WS-E1
     STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-OBS
     PERFORM ADD-OBS
     MOVE "1000000 0" TO TL-EXPECTED
     PERFORM CHECK-DONE

     MOVE "acceptance US14 28.5 worked example 3: n 130, p 0.1 uses the exact method with 130 draws (13 under 20)" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-OBSERVED
     MOVE 130000 TO WS-I1
     MOVE 100 TO WS-I2
     CALL "TOOL-BINOMIAL-METHOD" USING WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-O1
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-OBS
     MOVE WS-O1 TO WS-E1
     STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-OBS
     PERFORM ADD-OBS
     MOVE 130000 TO WS-I1
     CALL "TOOL-BINOMIAL-DRAWS" USING WS-I1 WS-O1
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-OBS
     MOVE WS-O1 TO WS-E1
     STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-OBS
     PERFORM ADD-OBS
     MOVE "0 130" TO TL-EXPECTED
     PERFORM CHECK-DONE

     STOP RUN.

 ADD-OBS.
     IF TL-OBSERVED = SPACES
         MOVE FUNCTION TRIM(WS-OBS) TO TL-OBSERVED
     ELSE
         STRING FUNCTION TRIM(TL-OBSERVED) " " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-OBS) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO TL-OBSERVED
     END-IF.

 CHECK-DONE.
     MOVE "T" TO TL-MODE
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT.
 END PROGRAM TEST-ENCH-5.
